The C program is small: read up to 1000 bytes from stdin with [38;5;10mfread[0m, then count occurrences of [38;5;10m'A'[0m and [38;5;10m'x'[0m in the resulting NUL-terminated string, printing [38;5;10mA: <n>[0m and [38;5;10mx: <n>[0m.[0m[0m
